  "renderedHtml": "</div> \n    </div>\n<div id='main' class='all_colors' data-scroll-offset=\"0\">\n<div id=\"av_section_1\" class=\" only-desktop avia-section main_color avia-section-no-padding avia-no-border-styling avia-full-stretch avia-bg-style-scroll  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_submenu  avia-builder-el-first   av-minimum-height av-minimum-height-custom container_wrap fullsize\" style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(\nhttps://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/structual.jpg); background-attachment: scroll; background-position: center center; \" data-section-bg-repeat=\"stretch\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"height:450px\"><main role=\"main\" itemprop=\"mainContentOfPage\" class=\"template-page content  av-content-full alpha units\"><div class=\"post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-22\"><div class=\"entry-content-wrapper clearfix\">\n</div></div></main></div></div>\n    <div id=\"av_section_mobile\" class=\" only-mobile\"  style=\"max-height:450px; max-width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/structual.jpg\"></div>\n<div class='clear'></div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"row\" id=\"introductionwelcome\" class=\"introductionwelcome\">\n\t<div  id=\"divintroductionThird\" class=\"divsectiontext\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;\">\n\t\t <br class=\"separatorintro\" />\n\t\t\t  <h1 style=\"margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0;\">Structural by Complete Restoration</h1>\n\t\t\t<h2>At the Complete Restoration Company we have a team of skilled advisors who work with us to ensure that your building becomes structurally sound and safe.  </h2>\n       </div> \n       <hr class=\"hrseparatortop\" style=\"margin-top:40px !important;\">\n    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n    <br class=\"tabseparatortop\" />\n </section>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n<section class=\"row target-section\" id=\"row_columns\" ><a name=\"featured\" class=\"anchor_position\"></a>\n  <div class=\"home-intro-texto\" id=\"landlords-column\">\n    <div class=\"divsectioncontent\"  >\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n                <h4 class='h4_inner'>Movement in old buildings can be seasonal, dictated by temperature changes. It could also be historic – i.e. there is evidence of past movement but there is no movement now. </h4>\n              <p>Only when the movement is ongoing and threatens the use or safety of the structure should you be concerned.</p>\n<p>If the movement is suspected to be ongoing then we can instruct structural engineer who is familiar with old buildings and he can make an inspection. The structural stability of an older house is dependent on how it all fits together. If the connections between the various components &#8211; walls, floors and roof structure &#8211; are unstable or inadequate then the building is vulnerable to disproportionate damage.</p>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n  </div>\n     <div class=\"\"  id=\"tenants-column\">\n<div class=\"\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/form_bricks.svg);no-repeat;cover;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n              <h2 id=\"form-title\">Get a Quote Today</h2>\n             <p id=\"form-subtitle\"></p>\n               <div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f521-p1942-o1\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"></div>\n<form action=\"/external/structural/#wpcf7-f521-p1942-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form form-contact\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" id=\"form-contact\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"521\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.1.3\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f521-p1942-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"1942\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" />\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-name\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"your-name\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Name:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-email\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-validates-as-email enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Email:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-tel\"><input type=\"tel\" name=\"your-tel\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-tel wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-validates-as-tel enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Tel:\" /></span></p>\n<div class=\"submit\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;\"><span id=\"confirm-btn\" class=\"\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Contact us\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit\" id=\"enquiry-send\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"divconsense\">\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap checkbox-923\"><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-checkbox wpcf7-validates-as-required\"><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item first last\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"checkbox-923[]\" value=\"By clicking confirm, you agree that we may process your information in accordance with these terms. Complete Restoration Ltd will use the information you provide on this form to be in touch with you and to provide updates and marketing via email. You can change your mind at any time by contacting us at &#039;info@completerestoration.co.uk&#039;. We will treat your information with respect. For more information about our privacy practices please visit the privacy policy page.\" /><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item-label\">By clicking confirm, you agree that we may process your information in accordance with these terms. Complete Restoration Ltd will use the information you provide on this form to be in touch with you and to provide updates and marketing via email. You can change your mind at any time by contacting us at &#039;info@completerestoration.co.uk&#039;. We will treat your information with respect. For more information about our privacy practices please visit the privacy policy page.</span></span></span></span> </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpcf7-response-output wpcf7-display-none\"></div></form></div>             </div>\n            </div>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    </section>    \n<section class=\"target-section target sectcompanies \" id=\"sectcompanies\">\n\t<div  class=\"accredited\">\n        <hr class=\"hrseparatortop\" />\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Proud members of...</h2>\n\t\t<br class=\"tabseparatortop\" />\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"companies\" >\n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/qualified_tile_association_tiler_suffolk.png\" >\n                     </li>   \n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Guild-Emblem-Transparent.png\" >\n                     </li>   \n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/niceic-logo.png\" >\n                     </li>   \n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-conten